sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Interface
    participant API
    participant Business Logic
    participant Database

    User->>Interface: Open create place form
    User->>Interface: Enter place details
    Interface->>API: Submit create place request
    API->>Business Logic: Validate place data
    Business Logic->>Database: Check if place already exists
    Database-->>Business Logic: Return existence status
    alt Place exists
        Business Logic-->>API: Return error (Place already exists)
        API-->>Interface: Show error message
    else Place does not exist
        Business Logic->>Database: Save new place
        Database-->>Business Logic: Confirmation
        Business Logic-->>API: Return success
        API-->>Interface: Show success message
    end
    Interface-->>User: Display creation result
